1025
01:00:21,518 --> 01:00:23,687
Let's wrap up practice for today,

1026
01:00:23,753 --> 01:00:26,256
and come to my place
for some makgeolli, okay?

1027
01:00:26,323 --> 01:00:28,325
-Shall we?
-I'm in!

1028
01:00:29,426 --> 01:00:30,727
Let's go, let's go.

1029
01:00:40,437 --> 01:00:42,506
What a load of bull.

1030
01:00:43,006 --> 01:00:45,876
That rude bastard from Sangdurok-ri…

1031
01:00:45,942 --> 01:00:47,811
I can't stand the sight of him.

1032
01:00:47,878 --> 01:00:49,546
Calm down, man.

1033
01:00:51,248 --> 01:00:53,483
Listen up, everyone!

1034
01:00:54,017 --> 01:00:56,520
We're winning this sports day!

1035
01:00:56,586 --> 01:00:57,454
Know why?

1036
01:00:57,521 --> 01:01:00,657
Because you have us, Excellent Souls!

1037
01:01:01,324 --> 01:01:04,394
So let's make sure we win
this sports day

1038
01:01:04,461 --> 01:01:07,697
and humble that fan-waving
fortune-teller Village Head

1039
01:01:07,764 --> 01:01:11,768
and all the people of Sangdurok-ri!

1040
01:01:11,835 --> 01:01:13,670
-Okay?
-Okay!

1041
01:01:13,737 --> 01:01:15,839
-Cheers!

1042
01:01:18,208 --> 01:01:22,279
This kid is finally making sense
for the first time.

1043
01:01:22,345 --> 01:01:24,614
Have a drink, have a drink.

1044
01:01:26,383 --> 01:01:27,317
Thank you, sir.

1045
01:01:27,384 --> 01:01:29,352
Sir, please pour me a glass too!

1046
01:01:31,888 --> 01:01:34,157
Goodness, have a drink too, Man-gu!

1047
01:01:34,224 --> 01:01:35,859
Chug from the bottle, chug it!

1048
01:01:35,926 --> 01:01:37,394
Let's all drink! You too!

1049
01:01:37,460 --> 01:01:38,995
Cheers, cheers!

1050
01:01:39,062 --> 01:01:41,565
Cheers, cheers! Chug from the bottle!

1051
01:01:42,332 --> 01:01:44,100
Thank you.

1052
01:01:44,167 --> 01:01:45,902
Su-yeon…

1053
01:01:47,070 --> 01:01:48,572
Su-yeon.

1054
01:01:49,439 --> 01:01:51,675
Even her name is so pretty.

1055
01:01:55,979 --> 01:01:59,182
But I embarrassed myself
in front of her again, seriously.

1056
01:02:00,050 --> 01:02:02,886
What do I do? This is driving me crazy.

1057
01:02:06,790 --> 01:02:09,893
So much for a pretty-boy band.
There's a glitch in the lineup.

1058
01:02:10,927 --> 01:02:13,496
You got in on talent, mister?

1059
01:02:15,665 --> 01:02:17,434
Who are you?

1060
01:02:17,500 --> 01:02:18,902
Han Sang-eun.

1061
01:02:18,969 --> 01:02:22,973
Someone who might share a stage
with you guys in a few years.

1062
01:02:23,039 --> 01:02:25,342
Call me a potential idol.

1063
01:02:25,408 --> 01:02:27,077
Potential idol?

1064
01:02:28,478 --> 01:02:30,380
You want to be an idol?

1065
01:02:30,447 --> 01:02:32,015
Yes.

1066
01:02:39,856 --> 01:02:41,925
Hey, hate to break it to you,

1067
01:02:41,992 --> 01:02:44,694
but you'll need plastic surgery
to be an idol.

1068
01:02:44,761 --> 01:02:46,196
I know.

1069
01:02:46,263 --> 01:02:48,131
So I'm saving up like crazy.

1070
01:02:48,198 --> 01:02:51,968
Man, kids these days
are so systematic.

1071
01:02:52,469 --> 01:02:56,606
You want to be an idol,
so why's your hair a mess?

1072
01:02:56,673 --> 01:02:58,341
This is my only option for now.

1073
01:02:58,408 --> 01:02:59,943
Dad buzzed it off.

1074
01:03:00,010 --> 01:03:02,512
What a horrible thing
to do to a daughter.

1075
01:03:02,579 --> 01:03:04,314
Hey, who's your dad?

1076
01:03:10,887 --> 01:03:12,756
It wasn't anything special.

1077
01:03:12,822 --> 01:03:14,557
Just talked about sports day.

1078
01:03:16,159 --> 01:03:18,194
These guys aren't that bad.

1079
01:03:18,895 --> 01:03:20,530
Why cuss at them like that?

1080
01:03:22,265 --> 01:03:23,800
Fine, I got it!

1081
01:03:23,867 --> 01:03:26,002
I'll go check the washer, okay?

1082
01:03:27,103 --> 01:03:28,371
See you later.

1083
01:03:30,440 --> 01:03:33,877
Which of those moves
possibly meant "washing machine"?

1084
01:03:33,943 --> 01:03:35,478
How did she get that?

1085
01:03:35,545 --> 01:03:37,013
Never mind them.

1086
01:03:37,080 --> 01:03:40,850
It's a special sign language
only those two understand.

1087
01:03:42,018 --> 01:03:42,986
All right, now!

1088
01:03:43,053 --> 01:03:46,556
You all worked hard today,
so let's have a drink.

1089
01:03:46,623 --> 01:03:50,660
Here's the toast:
three cheers for Hadurok-ri!

1090
01:03:50,727 --> 01:03:52,128
Long live Hadurok-ri!

1091
01:03:52,195 --> 01:03:55,165
Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!
